{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cuv","name":"新標點和合本","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89t","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89t","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CUV","englishName":"Chinese Union Version (traditional)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"923f114ccc6ab7fc558e054f84df5214fa9782ca7c02882cf173417a0d1d641e","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":31021,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"ZEC","translationId":"cmn_cuv","name":"撒迦利亞書","commonName":"撒迦利亞書","title":"撒迦利亞書","order":38,"numberOfChapters":14,"sha256":"596e12e88f20bda085f475cd8057e433ebcfbd7db4b18a72e7597b0902128ee5","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/ZEC/1.json","lastChapterNumber":14,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/ZEC/14.json","totalNumberOfVerses":211},"chapter":{"number":13,"content":[{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["「那日，必給大衛家和耶路撒冷的居民開一個泉源，洗除罪惡與污穢。」"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["萬軍之耶和華說：「那日，我必從地上除滅偶像的名，不再被人記念；也必使這地不再有假先知與污穢的靈。"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["若再有人說預言，生他的父母必對他說：『你不得存活，因為你託耶和華的名說假預言。』生他的父母在他說預言的時候，要將他刺透。"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["那日，凡作先知說預言的必因他所論的異象羞愧，不再穿毛衣哄騙人。"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["他必說：『我不是先知，我是耕地的；我從幼年作人的奴僕。』"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["必有人問他說：『你兩臂中間是甚麼傷呢？』他必回答說：『這是我在親友家中所受的傷。』」"]},{"type":"heading","content":["牧人被殺"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"text":"萬軍之耶和華說：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"刀劍哪，應當興起，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"攻擊我的牧人和我的同伴。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"擊打牧人，羊就分散；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我必反手加在微小者的身上。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和華說：這全地的人，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"三分之二必剪除而死，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"三分之一仍必存留。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要使這三分之一經火，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"熬煉他們，如熬煉銀子；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"試煉他們，如試煉金子。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們必求告我的名，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我必應允他們。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要說：這是我的子民。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們也要說：耶和華是我們的上帝。","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/ZEC/13.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/ZEC/14.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/ZEC/12.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":9}